@format 1
@id ui-event.62e724086f3f7fa6
@title Current schedule changed
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@event-ref cs|PMainArea/LCourier.cs|LCourierStart|PProgram.LScheduleCurrent|LScheduleChange|1
@entry input
@summary Dispatch completed relay work through delivery acceptance, retry bookkeeping, source cleanup, and downstream arrival.
@tag schedule change
@tag LCourier
@alias owner = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LCourier

[input] Current schedule changed <input>
- Receive the schedule event through the one-time courier subscription @ owner.LCourierStart
> dispatch

[dispatch] Dispatch relay candidates <process>
- Forward the schedule to the courier dispatcher @ owner.LCourierScheduleHandle
- Select done, locally owned, targeted work that is not already delivered @ owner.LCourierDispatch
> delivery

[delivery] Deliver completed output <process>
- Reserve each work ID, attempt output delivery, and remove the reservation on rejection or exception @ owner.LCourierDispatch
> map:relay.deliver-output
